#20400
Quest Playing Field - Additions~
Due to the large amount of players and changes that the Flag games go
through, I've decided to add some additions to smooth out the gameplay.

Since the secret door concept is not 'secret', ill be adding a dungeon area 
underneath the flag game playing field. This will act as a 'Gauntlet'
that is..a set of rooms with some soundproof, !recall, flags in them.

The gauntlet will be linear with a center what has 3 branches..each 'branch will
be a tunnel, hence blockable..making the center the only way through.
Ultimately, what i would prefer is a set of 'Duel' rooms, that allow only
2 players in, forcing a number of one on one confrontations. Hopefully
channeling the area will cause this anyways.
I should add a few one way rooms as well. Maybe 4 branches. 2 one way.
and 2  2 ways.

Kurse 1999
~
204 520 0 0 0 0 255 0
S
#20401
&00The Gauntlet - &05Black&00 Dungeon~
   You arrive in a short corridor, lit only by the torches that flank the
walls.  Strangely enough, the walls themselves are made of ebony as black as
night, and split off into three corridors, none of which you can see very far
into.  Dare you run the Gauntlet?    
