#20402
The Black Gauntlet~
   You have entered into a tunnel constructed of perfectly shaped bricks of
ebony, forming a perfectly smooth surface.  Great care was taken into the
creation of this passage, indicating that it may be of some importance.  It
goes as far as the eye can see to the east.  You can see the entry to the black
gauntlet to the west.    
