#20404
The Black Atrium~
   The tunnel widens at this point to a larger circular room with passages in
all directions.  As soon as you step into the chamber, your magical items which
glow begin to fade, as well as your spells, leading you to believe that there
is some type of anti magic enchantment in place.  An odd humming noise emanates
from the east.    
