#20405
The Black Machine Room~
   You have entered an odd chamber of metal and stone.  Immense steel pipes,
gears, and wheels lie embedded into the rock overhead in a complex
configuration.  Suspecting that this is the mechanism used to raise and lower
the colossal Portcullis above the earth, you follow the maze of pipes down to a
gearbox on the wall.  An obvious gnomish invention, the gearbox is covered with
a number of odd looking buttons you dare not press.  A central alcove lies to
the east.    
~
