#20410
The Gaping Maw~
   The ground disappears from under your feet, giving way to an enourmous black
chasm.  The edges of the huge hole are jagged, with many sharp outcrops, giving
it the frightening appearance of a enourmous mouth trying to swallow you whole.
A terrible wind roars from the depths, near blowing you into the edged rocks.
  
