#20424
Deep Water~
   You swim far beneath the surface of the world for what seems like an
eternity.  Small bioluminescent creatures occasionally drift by..  Their
sightless bodies glowing faintly.  You are surrounded on all sides by a
darkness that seeks to consume you.  Envelope you.  Glancing upwards, you
notice that the water is lighter.    
