#20428
&07The Central Alcove&00~
   You have entered into a narrowed passageway which has been cut smoothly out
of the bedrock.  The base of the massive portcullis sits high above your head,
indicating that this indeed is the center of the dungeon.  Small metal slats
lie in the rock underneath your feet.  Given its size, you estimate that this
room would be perfect to defend against the enemy, as no-one will be able to
pass you into the room beyond.  As you take a step, you think you hear a
'click'.    
~
